      <tei:p>Find Isaiah 30:26</tei:p>
    </tei:note>
    <tei:note type="commentary" n="44" target="#note_44">
      <tei:p>According to a midrash also found in Qallir and some gaonic commentaries, while it appears that the Divine Throne is carried on the four beast-angels of Ezekiel 1, in fact the beast-angels are carried by the Divine Throne.</tei:p>
